Rows of aliases.tsv whose `licence` column says otherwise keep the licence
named there: rows marked `CC0-1.0` come from Wikidata, rows marked
`public-domain` from US government sources. Rows marked `CC-BY-4.0` are either
our own curation or (source `ncit`) from the NCI Thesaurus, credited in
README.md.

